Feature 1: number of packets received. FlowMonitor has rxPackets, which is a cumulative counter. So I'll take the difference of rxPackets over each interval. So source is rxPackets, diff is true, scale is 1.

Feature 2: number of bytes received. Similarly, FlowMonitor has rxBytes, which is cumulative. So take the difference, no scaling needed. So source is rxBytes, diff true, scale 1.

